        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Before Your Eyes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/d76ce4ba31b3a7bbc75cf548254ceebb.avif?t=1783634621\" width=616 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Isaac, a 6-month-old baby, developing mysterious psychic powers. What you want most is to be loved and accepted by your family, but a secretive tech corporation wants you for their own. The game features an immersive “camera as controller” mode, expanding on the innovative use of camera-based technology that the development team is known for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/4818add4c4fc4bca1befca7f53c59a16.webp?t=1783634621\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/90aaa04b545e9bcd183fa6a9f9fba5d9.poster.avif?t=1783634621\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/90aaa04b545e9bcd183fa6a9f9fba5d9.webm?t=1783634621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/90aaa04b545e9bcd183fa6a9f9fba5d9.mp4?t=1783634621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416100/extras/e9d48d125105de1d50d40e87e3d14188.poster.avif?t=1783634621\" width=616 height=230 ><source src